/*!
\page page_sttrackfittraits StTrackFitTraits

\brief Track-fit quality quantities: fit-point counts, chi-squared, and covariance matrix.

\section sttrackfittraits_overview Overview

\ref StTrackFitTraits is embedded directly in every \c StTrack.  It stores:
- The particle-hypothesis GEANT ID used in the fit.
- Per-detector counts of hits included in the fit.
- χ² of the fit and the vertex-constraint contribution.
- A flag indicating whether the primary vertex was used as a constraint.
- The packed 5×5 track-parameter covariance matrix (15 upper-triangle floats).

\section sttrackfittraits_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
StObject
  └── StTrackFitTraits
\endcode

\section sttrackfittraits_members Data Members

| Member | Description |
|---|---|
| \c mPidHypothesis | GEANT particle ID of the fit hypothesis. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsTpc | TPC fit-point count. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsFtpcWest | FTPC west fit points. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsFtpcEast | FTPC east fit points. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsSvt | SVT fit points. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsSsd | SSD fit points. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsSst | SST fit points. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsPxl | PXL fit points. |
| \c mNumberOfFitPointsIst | IST fit points. |
| \c mPrimaryVertexUsedInFit | Vertex-constraint flag. |
| \c mChi2[2] | χ²[0] = total, χ²[1] = vertex contribution. |
| \c mCovariantMatrix | 15-element packed upper-triangle covariance (TArrayF). |

\section sttrackfittraits_cov Covariance Matrix

The 5×5 symmetric covariance matrix is packed as 15 upper-triangle elements
in the order: (y,y), (y,z), (y,tanλ), (y,ψ), (y,1/p_T), (z,z), …, (1/p_T,1/p_T).

\section sttrackfittraits_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StTrackFitTraits& fit = track->fitTraits();
double chi2   = fit.chi2();
bool   vtxUsed = fit.primaryVertexUsedInFit();
unsigned short nFit = fit.numberOfFitPoints();

StMatrixF cov  = fit.covariantMatrix();
double sigPti  = std::sqrt(cov(5,5));  // 1-based index
\endcode

\see StTrack
*/
